        <title type="html"><![CDATA[URL Pattern API updates]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40674</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40674"/>
        <updated>2025-08-08T07:06:40.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF142 adds support for the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URLPattern" rel="nofollow">URL Pattern API</a> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The docs are a little out of date according to the spec (i.e. in <a href="https://github.com/whatwg/urlpattern/pull/198/files">https://github.com/whatwg/urlpattern/pull/198/files</a>). This attempts to fix them.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30024.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1976775237" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30024" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/30024/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30024">#30024</a></p>
